<title>USA: Argyle Television Q1 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Argyle Television Q1 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argyle Television Inc.</p>
<p>	    Condensed Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>				  (Unaudited)</p>
<p>		   (In thousands, except per-share data)</p>
<p>							Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							 March 31,</p>
<p>						  1996		1997</p>
<p> Total revenues			    $15,495	  $17,879</p>
<p> Net loss				    (4,330)	  (6,203)</p>
<p> Loss per common share		    (0.39)	   (0.58)</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>  common shares outstanding	     11,119	   11,347</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) Includes results from WZZM, WAPT, WNAC, KITV and WGRZ for the entire period.</p>
<p>(b) Includes results from WAPT, KITV and the Arkansas stations for the entire period, WZZM and WGRZ for January, WLWT and KOCO for February-March, and the company's share of the Clear Channel venture (WNAC/WPRI) for the entire period.</p>
<p>The company's share of the Clear Channel venture broadcast cash flow is included in total revenues.</p>
